WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.327
- Well, I don't wanna say that because

00:00:01.327 --> 00:00:04.661
that means I'm going to

00:00:04.661 --> 00:00:06.389
- We're all in a long
march towards death, but.

00:00:06.389 --> 00:00:07.527
- No, we are not.

00:00:07.527 --> 00:00:11.171
(lively music)

00:00:12.821 --> 00:00:14.005
- Hi, I'm Sam Stryker.

00:00:14.005 --> 00:00:14.957
- And I'm Curly.

00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:17.139
- And we're at the Film
Independent Spirit Awards

00:00:17.139 --> 00:00:20.104
in Santa Monica, where
we're gonna ask celebrities

00:00:20.104 --> 00:00:23.710
if they've had any
encounters with spirits.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.173
We've been gravely disappointed.

00:00:25.173 --> 00:00:26.984
We thought there were
going to be actual spirits

00:00:26.984 --> 00:00:28.145
at the awards today.

00:00:28.145 --> 00:00:30.165
- Oh, that's why you're
here, to protect us?

00:00:30.165 --> 00:00:31.373
- Do you believe in ghosts?

00:00:31.373 --> 00:00:31.976
We'll get right to it.

00:00:31.976 --> 00:00:33.300
- Yeah, who doesn't.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.438
- I'm dead inside.

00:00:34.438 --> 00:00:35.366
I'm a total skeptic.

00:00:35.366 --> 00:00:37.781
- Although sometimes I'm creeped out.

00:00:37.781 --> 00:00:38.803
- I believe in ghosts, yeah.

00:00:38.803 --> 00:00:40.614
- Have you ever had a
paranormal experience?

00:00:40.614 --> 00:00:42.262
- No, but I'm really hopeful.

00:00:42.262 --> 00:00:43.493
- Hundreds.

00:00:43.493 --> 00:00:44.375
Thousands, probably.

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:45.652
- I mean, I've had moments
where I've been scared

00:00:45.652 --> 00:00:48.485
where I'm like, "Mmm, I'm
not going down that hallway,"

00:00:48.485 --> 00:00:51.179
because I just feel it's not
a good thing to do right now.

00:00:51.179 --> 00:00:52.084
I'll do it tomorrow.

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:54.476
- Something kept changing the TV channel,

00:00:54.476 --> 00:00:56.008
and I wasn't touching the remote.

00:00:56.008 --> 00:00:58.214
- Netflix and chill,
but with like a ghost.

00:00:58.214 --> 00:00:59.352
- Exactly.

00:00:59.352 --> 00:01:00.582
There was no chill, zero chill.

00:01:00.582 --> 00:01:02.811
- And I was walking past
and like in the corner

00:01:02.811 --> 00:01:06.294
of my face like I saw
something like hanging.

00:01:06.294 --> 00:01:09.011
- Was Sia hanging from the chandelier or?

00:01:09.011 --> 00:01:12.029
- We love you, Cate.

00:01:12.029 --> 00:01:14.003
- Oh my God.

00:01:14.003 --> 00:01:15.257
Oh my God.

00:01:15.257 --> 00:01:16.998
Cate Blanchett just said we look fabulous.

00:01:16.998 --> 00:01:19.599
Who would you come back and haunt?

00:01:19.599 --> 00:01:20.690
- You, both of you.

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:21.665
- Yes.

00:01:21.665 --> 00:01:23.569
- I would wanna haunt a descendant of mine

00:01:23.569 --> 00:01:24.707
that I haven't met yet.

00:01:24.707 --> 00:01:26.123
- Probably my kids.

00:01:26.123 --> 00:01:28.561
- So like a happy haunt.

00:01:28.561 --> 00:01:29.792
- Yeah, I'd happy haunt them.

00:01:29.792 --> 00:01:32.624
- I wouldn't haunt, but
I would follow my exes

00:01:32.624 --> 00:01:33.716
to see what they're up to.

00:01:33.716 --> 00:01:34.923
- Yes.

00:01:34.923 --> 00:01:36.757
- I would haunt DisneyLand so I could just

00:01:36.757 --> 00:01:39.544
go on all the rides and I'd
get to skip all the lines.

00:01:39.544 --> 00:01:41.842
- I don't need to die
to haunt Donald Trump.

00:01:41.842 --> 00:01:43.862
I'd like to haunt Donald Trump
for the rest of his life.

00:01:43.862 --> 00:01:45.929
- All right, guys, that was
the Independent Spirit Awards.

00:01:45.929 --> 00:01:47.508
We didn't see any ghosts,

00:01:47.508 --> 00:01:49.435
but we saw plenty of stars,

00:01:49.435 --> 00:01:52.964
and Cate Blanchett said
we looked fabulous, so.

00:01:52.964 --> 00:01:53.870
- She meant me, I think.

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:57.446
(upbeat music)

